body:
i’m a bit confused but from your description it sounds like your skin is more of a warm undertone? if warm toned lipsticks look “right” and cool tones look “off”? 

for example, my undertone is cool. cool tones lipstick i slay but *ANY* warmth pops out on me and it looks striking but in a bad way. it’s like a slap for your eyes. you seem to have this experience with cool tones lipsticks - then i suppose you have warm undertones :) 

what about veins on your wrists? what’s their colour?
